# 28_noise_sleep_bed_RGB.ledc — AM-Noise Sleep Bed (smooth), RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 28_noise_sleep_bed. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (0.85 Hz sine-AM pink bed +
# steady brown warmth). The light is STEADY (freq 0, no flicker), dim warm amber: inner
# ring amber (mask 9, 255,160,32) + outer ring deep red (mask 6, 255,24,16). Steady red is
# safe (no flicker). Brightness <=12%; ends dark + silent. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask   (freq 0 = STEADY)

# --- Settle: dim amber steady light + noise fade-in ---
0 0 100 >0 255 160 32 9          # inner amber: steady, bright fade-in
0 0 100 >0 255 24 16 6           # outer deep-red: steady halo
A 0 200 0 >0 0.85 1 0 5           # ch1 pink noise, 0.85 Hz sine AM; vol fade-in
A 0 100 0 >0 0 2 0 6              # ch2 brown noise, steady warm bed; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Settling in. Let the soft rush of sound carry you toward sleep."
15000 0 100 12 255 160 32 9      # inner: 12% (dim)
15000 0 100 12 255 24 16 6       # outer
A 60000 200 0 90 0.85 1 0 5        # ch1 pink vol settled
A 60000 100 0 60 0 2 0 6           # ch2 brown vol settled

# --- Hold: steady dim light + AM pink bed + brown warmth ---
S 600000 default 65 "Breathing slow. Nothing to do now but drift."

# --- Soft Off: brightness + both noise beds fade to 0 (no wake-up) ---
1680000 0 100 >12 255 160 32 9    # inner: brightness ramp-out
1680000 0 100 >12 255 24 16 6     # outer
A 1680000 200 0 *90 0.85 1 0 5     # ch1 pink quad fade
A 1680000 100 0 *60 0 2 0 6        # ch2 brown quad fade
S 1680000 default 65 "The sound is fading now. Let go completely. Sleep."
1800000 0 100 0 255 160 32 9      # inner off (dark)
1800000 0 100 0 255 24 16 6       # outer off
A 1800000 200 0 0 0.85 1 0 5       # pink 0
A 1800000 100 0 0 0 2 0 6          # brown 0 (silent)
